In light of the current situation with Coronavirus/Covid-19, many industry events have been rescheduled or cancelled. Below is a running list of events affected by the current health crisis:
The summit, originally set to take place June 1-2, 2020 at the Westin Hotel in Jersey City, New Jersey, has been postponed. More information and new dates are forthcoming.
AWA Conferences & Events are postponing the AWA International Sleeve Label Conference in Cincinnati, Ohio, originally scheduled to take place between 29 April and 1 May. The event will now take place 2-4 November 2020 in the same location.
Finat plans to integrate parts of the ELF into their technical seminar, which will be held in November/December 2020 in Barcelona. The exact date and further details are forthcoming.
Due to the hastened nature of this decision, the cancellation policy details are forthcoming for those who had registered to attend, purchased a booth, or paid for a sponsorship.
