LNG terminalis an organic whole composed of many relevant equipment assemblies. Through the cooperation of these equipment, the LNG transported by sea can be stored in LNG storage tank and exported to users through certain process flow.
Storage tank is the place where LNG is stored, and the selection shall be considered from the comprehensive factors such as safety, investment, operation cost and environmental protection. LNG storage tank is a large storage tank with atmospheric pressure and low temperature.
Low pressure transfer pump Its function is to extract LNG from the storage tank and send it to the downstream device.
Bog compressor It is used for pressurization and gas transmission, that is, part of the evaporated gas generated in the storage tank is boosted by the compressor and enters the Recondenser for condensation, and then sent to the carburetor together with the exported LNG through the high-pressure export pump.
The function of Flare Tower is to burn waste gas and adjust the pressure in the tank at the same time.
