As for dinner, it is best to opt for low-calorie and light dishes such as grilled vegetables or oatmeal with some fruit.
Apart from the alkaline diet there are another series of elements that can help you balance the pH in the blood and avoid future health problems.
It is important to purify the body from time to time. To do this, in addition to drinking water you can make diuretic-type drinks that help clean the inside of the body and eliminate toxins.
As you can see, the alkaline diet cannot be considered as a miracle diet since you do not seek excessive weight loss in the shortest time possible. It is also not proven that it has a rebound effect towards the person who decides to follow it.
