2 Who are anti-inflammatory diets for?
These meal plans are especially recommended for those who suffer from diseases that cause inflammation, such as rheumatoid arthritis. Making changes to the diet does not eliminate the inflammatory problem, but it is believed that it can alleviate its symptoms, either by reducing the number of flare-ups or decreasing the level of pain.
