Surely you have heard millions of times, speak to nutritionists and doctors of this country of the many benefits it has Mediterranean diet for health and body. The Mediterranean diet dates back several centuries and is a very healthy way of feeding that all towns of the Mediterranean zone follow.
There is no single Mediterranean diet, there are many varieties in this type of diet because many countries follow this type of diet. However, despite some differences and peculiarities, the Mediterranean diet has a series of common features and that they share in all countries.
It is very common to use products such as onion and garlic and use them as a basis in the preparation of different dishes.
The meals of the Mediterranean diet are usually accompanied with a glass of Rioja wine.
Consumption rice and pasta In this type of diet it is usually quite high, specifically about 3 or 4 times a week.
This study revealed the great difference that existed between the number of deaths due to from heart-related diseases in countries like the US with other countries like Greece. This difference was due to the type of food and the way of life that each society led.
Nowadays Mediterranean diet it does not have the importance of a few years ago and has been displaced by another type of diet less elaborate and less healthy for the body. Long hours of work and the incorporation of women into the world of work have led to a better choice for a type of fast food.
Most nutritionists and specialists in our country point out that it is very important to follow a diet like the mediterranean to prevent possible cardiovascular diseases, always united to the daily development of a little exercise or physical activity. With these two elements so easy and simple to comply with, the experts assure that the person's weight will be adequate And there won't be any excess weight problems.
